+Every Phase-A/C/D claim is **oracle-distinct** (`verifier_is_oracle=false` +
+matched control + CI95-excl-0). ARC SOLVEs are execution-grounded
+(`verifier_is_oracle=true`) — ARC progress, NOT a moat headline (Circularity
+Discipline).
